#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_advanced_options.rst:2
msgid "VM Advanced Options"
msgstr "Opciones avanzadas de VM"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_advanced_options.rst:4
msgid ""
"When provisioning or reconfiguring HVM virtual machines, the **Advanced "
"Options** section provides controls for firmware, boot behavior, "
"security, graphics, and virtualization settings. These options are found "
"on the CONFIGURE tab during provisioning or through the "
":guilabel:`Actions` > :guilabel:`Reconfigure` menu on an existing VM."
msgstr ""
"Al aprovisionar o reconfigurar máquinas virtuales HVM, la sección "
"**Advanced Options** proporciona controles para firmware, comportamiento "
"de arranque, seguridad, gráficos y configuración de virtualización. Estas"
" opciones se encuentran en la pestaña CONFIGURE durante el "
"aprovisionamiento o mediante el menú :guilabel:`Actions` > "
":guilabel:`Reconfigure` en una VM existente."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_advanced_options.rst:6
msgid "Note"
msgstr "Nota"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_advanced_options.rst:6
msgid ""
"Most Advanced Options are available at both provisioning and "
":guilabel:`Actions` > :guilabel:`Reconfigure`. A few remain provision-"
"only or reconfigure-only; see the availability table. Changing chipset, "
"firmware, boot, TPM, nested virtualization, graphics, QEMU arguments, or "
"identity options on an existing VM is a cold reconfigure. You do not need"
" to power the VM off first; |morpheus| powers it off if the change "
"requires a restart, regenerates the configuration, and starts it again."
msgstr ""
"La mayoría de las Advanced Options están disponibles tanto en el "
"aprovisionamiento como en :guilabel:`Actions` > :guilabel:`Reconfigure`. "
"Algunas permanecen solo para aprovisionamiento o solo para "
"reconfiguración; consulte la tabla de disponibilidad. Cambiar el "
"chipset, firmware, arranque, TPM, virtualización anidada, gráficos, "
"argumentos QEMU o las opciones de identidad en una VM existente es una "
"reconfiguración en frío. No es necesario apagar la VM primero; "
"|morpheus| la apaga si el cambio requiere un reinicio, regenera la "
"configuración y la inicia de nuevo."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_advanced_options.rst:9
msgid "Changing Advanced Options on an existing VM"
msgstr "Cambio de Advanced Options en una VM existente"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_advanced_options.rst:11
msgid "Navigate to |ProIns| (or the HVM cluster VM detail page)."
msgstr "Vaya a |ProIns| (o a la página de detalle de la VM del clúster HVM)."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_advanced_options.rst:12
msgid "Open :guilabel:`Actions` > :guilabel:`Reconfigure`."
msgstr "Abra :guilabel:`Actions` > :guilabel:`Reconfigure`."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_advanced_options.rst:13
msgid ""
"Expand **Advanced Options** and change Hardware Compatibility, UEFI, "
"Secure Boot, BIOS Host Mode, Network Boot, TPM, QEMU Arguments, Nested "
"Virtualization, Disable Emulated Graphics, Asset Tag, or the other "
"reconfigure-capable fields in the table below."
msgstr ""
"Expanda **Advanced Options** y cambie Hardware Compatibility, UEFI, "
"Secure Boot, BIOS Host Mode, Network Boot, TPM, QEMU Arguments, Nested "
"Virtualization, Disable Emulated Graphics, Asset Tag, u otros campos "
"que admitan reconfiguración en la tabla siguiente."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_advanced_options.rst:14
msgid ""
"Apply the reconfigure. If the change cannot be applied while the VM is "
"running, |morpheus| powers the VM off, regenerates the definition, and "
"starts it."
msgstr ""
"Aplique la reconfiguración. Si el cambio no se puede aplicar mientras la"
" VM está en ejecución, |morpheus| apaga la VM, regenera la definición y"
" la inicia."

