#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_advanced_options.rst:71
msgid ""
"Enables an emulated Trusted Platform Module (TPM) device for the VM using"
" software TPM (swtpm). Required for Windows 11 and other operating "
"systems that mandate TPM 2.0. TPM state is stored on shared storage and "
"is automatically recovered during VM failover."
msgstr ""
"Habilita un dispositivo Trusted Platform Module (TPM) emulado para la VM"
" usando TPM por software (swtpm). Requerido para Windows 11 y otros "
"sistemas operativos que exigen TPM 2.0. El estado del TPM se almacena en"
" almacenamiento compartido y se recupera automáticamente durante la "
"conmutación por error de la VM."
"Habilita un dispositivo Trusted Platform Module (TPM) emulado para la VM "
"usando TPM por software (swtpm). Requerido para Windows 11 y otros "
"sistemas operativos que exigen TPM 2.0. El estado TPM se almacena en "
"almacenamiento compartido y se recupera automáticamente durante la "
"conmutación por error de la VM."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_advanced_options.rst:74
msgid "QEMU & Virtualization"
msgstr "QEMU y virtualización"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_advanced_options.rst:90
msgid "Warning"
msgstr "Advertencia"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_advanced_options.rst:90
msgid ""
"Use QEMU Arguments with caution. Invalid arguments can prevent the VM "
"from starting. Consult KVM/QEMU documentation for valid options."
msgstr ""
"Use Argumentos QEMU con precaución. Los argumentos no válidos pueden "
"impedir que la VM se inicie. Consulte la documentación de KVM/QEMU para "
"opciones válidas."
"Use Argumentos QEMU con precaución. Los argumentos no válidos pueden "
"impedir que la VM se inicie. Consulte la documentación de KVM/QEMU para "
"opciones válidas."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_advanced_options.rst:93
msgid "CPU Model (Cluster-Level Setting)"
msgstr "Modelo de CPU (configuración a nivel de clúster)"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_advanced_options.rst:95
msgid ""
"The **CPU Model** determines how the host's CPU is presented to guest "
"VMs. This is a **cluster-level** setting configured when creating or "
"editing the cluster, and applies to all VMs in the cluster."
msgstr ""
"El **CPU Model** determina cómo se presenta la CPU del host a las VMs "
"invitadas. Esta es una configuración **a nivel de clúster** definida al "
"crear o editar el clúster, y se aplica a todas las VMs del clúster."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_advanced_options.rst:101
msgid "Mode"
msgstr "Modo"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_advanced_options.rst:103
msgid "Host Passthrough (default)"
msgstr "Host Passthrough (predeterminado)"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_advanced_options.rst:104
msgid ""
"Exposes the exact host CPU model and all its features directly to the "
"guest. Provides maximum performance and access to all CPU instructions "
"(AES-NI, AVX-512, etc.). VMs see the real CPU model name."
msgstr ""
"Expone el modelo exacto de CPU del host y todas sus características "
"directamente al invitado. Proporciona el máximo rendimiento y acceso a "
"todas las instrucciones de CPU (AES-NI, AVX-512, etc.). Las VMs ven el "
"nombre real del modelo de CPU."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_advanced_options.rst:105
msgid "Host Model"
msgstr "Host Model"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_advanced_options.rst:106
msgid ""
"Uses a CPU model that closely matches the host but is defined by the "
"hypervisor's CPU compatibility library. Provides good performance while "
"allowing limited heterogeneity between cluster hosts."
msgstr ""
"Usa un modelo de CPU que coincide estrechamente con el host pero está "
"definido por la biblioteca de compatibilidad de CPU del hipervisor. "
"Proporciona buen rendimiento permitiendo heterogeneidad limitada entre "
"hosts del clúster."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_advanced_options.rst:107
msgid "Named Model"
msgstr "Named Model"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_advanced_options.rst:108
msgid ""
"Specifies an exact CPU model name (e.g., ``Skylake-Server``, ``EPYC``). "
"The guest sees only features defined by that model, regardless of what "
"the host actually supports. Maximum portability."
msgstr ""
"Especifica un nombre exacto de modelo de CPU (p. ej., ``Skylake-Server``,"
" ``EPYC``). El invitado ve solo las características definidas por ese "
"modelo, independientemente de lo que el host admita realmente. Máxima "
"portabilidad."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_advanced_options.rst:111
msgid "CPU Compatibility and Migration"
msgstr "Compatibilidad de CPU y migración"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_advanced_options.rst:113
msgid ""
"The default is **Host Passthrough**. For a VM without nested "
"virtualization, |morpheus| marks this CPU definition as migratable. This "
"flag does not establish that every pair of different physical CPU models "
"is compatible; validate live migration between every host model admitted "
"to the cluster."
msgstr ""
"El predeterminado es **Host Passthrough**. Para una VM sin virtualización"
" anidada, |morpheus| marca esta definición de CPU como migrable. Este "
"indicador no establece que cada par de modelos físicos de CPU diferentes "
"sea compatible; valide la migración en vivo entre cada modelo de host "
"admitido en el clúster."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_advanced_options.rst:115
msgid ""
"A **Named Model** is emitted with exact model matching. Select a model "
"that every source and destination host supports. The product "
"implementation does not automatically select a universal \"lowest\" CPU "
"model, so do not infer a model from processor age or marketing generation"
" alone."
msgstr ""
"Un **Named Model** se emite con coincidencia exacta de modelo. Seleccione"
" un modelo que admitan todos los hosts de origen y destino. La "
"implementación del producto no selecciona automáticamente un modelo de "
"CPU universal \"más bajo\", así que no infiera un modelo solo por la "
"antigüedad o generación comercial del procesador."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_advanced_options.rst:117
msgid ""
"When nested virtualization is enabled with Host Passthrough, |morpheus| "
"marks the CPU non-migratable so VMX/SVM features remain exposed. Treat "
"that VM as ineligible for live migration."
msgstr ""
"Cuando la virtualización anidada está habilitada con Host Passthrough, "
"|morpheus| marca la CPU como no migrable para que las características "
"VMX/SVM sigan expuestas. Trate esa VM como no elegible para migración en "
"vivo."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_advanced_options.rst:119
msgid "See :doc:`vm_migration` for the mixed-host preflight checks."
msgstr ""
"Consulte :doc:`vm_migration` para las comprobaciones previas con hosts "
"mixtos."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_advanced_options.rst:122
msgid "ISO and Network Installation"
msgstr "Instalación ISO y de red"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_advanced_options.rst:124
msgid ""
"For an interactive ISO installation, add an ISO Virtual Image as "
"described in :doc:`/library/virtual_images/virtual_images`, provision the"
" HVM VM from that image, and complete the guest installer from the "
"console. After installation, eject the installation media and restart the"
" VM so it boots from its installed disk."
msgstr ""
"Para una instalación interactiva desde ISO, agregue una Virtual Image ISO"
" como se describe en :doc:`/library/virtual_images/virtual_images`, "
"aprovisione la VM HVM desde esa imagen y complete el instalador del "
"invitado desde la consola. Tras la instalación, expulse el medio de "
"instalación y reinicie la VM para que arranque desde su disco instalado."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_advanced_options.rst:126
msgid ""
"For PXE/network installation, enable **Network Boot** and select a "
"primary VM network that can reach the environment's DHCP and PXE "
"services. The primary NIC is placed first in the boot order. After "
"installation, disable **Network Boot** through :guilabel:`Actions` > "
":guilabel:`Reconfigure`; the root disk then returns to boot order 1."
msgstr ""
"Para instalación PXE/red, habilite **Network Boot** y seleccione una red "
"principal de VM que pueda alcanzar los servicios DHCP y PXE del entorno. "
"La NIC principal se coloca primero en el orden de arranque. Tras la "
"instalación, deshabilite **Network Boot** mediante :guilabel:`Actions` > "
":guilabel:`Reconfigure`; el disco raíz vuelve entonces al orden de "
"arranque 1."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_advanced_options.rst:128
msgid "Important"
msgstr "Importante"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_advanced_options.rst:130
msgid ""
"VM network boot consumes an existing PXE service from a virtual NIC. It "
"is not the |morpheus| bare-metal discovery and provisioning workflow "
"documented under :doc:`/infrastructure/pxeboot/pxeboot`."
msgstr ""
"El arranque de red de VM consume un servicio PXE existente desde una NIC "
"virtual. No es el flujo de descubrimiento y aprovisionamiento bare metal "
"de |morpheus| documentado en :doc:`/infrastructure/pxeboot/pxeboot`."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_advanced_options.rst:133
msgid "Drivers & Graphics"
msgstr "Controladores y gráficos"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_advanced_options.rst:142
#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_advanced_options.rst:220
msgid "Attach VirtIO Drivers"
msgstr "Attach VirtIO Drivers"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_advanced_options.rst:144
msgid ""
"Attaches a VirtIO drivers ISO to the VM as a secondary CD-ROM device. "
"Enable this when provisioning Windows guests from an ISO to install "
"VirtIO storage and network drivers during OS setup. See "
":doc:`guest_os_notes` for the installation procedure. *Provision only.*"
msgstr ""
"Adjunta una ISO de controladores VirtIO a la VM como dispositivo CD-ROM "
"secundario. Habilite esto al aprovisionar invitados Windows desde una ISO"
" para instalar controladores VirtIO de almacenamiento y red durante la "
"configuración del SO. Consulte :doc:`guest_os_notes` para el "
"procedimiento de instalación. *Solo aprovisionamiento.*"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_advanced_options.rst:145
#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_advanced_options.rst:223
msgid "Disable Emulated Graphics"
msgstr "Disable Emulated Graphics"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_advanced_options.rst:147
msgid ""
"Disables the emulated video/graphics adapter. Use this for headless VMs "
"that do not require console access, such as dedicated appliances or GPU-"
"passthrough workloads where the physical GPU provides the display."
msgstr ""
"Deshabilita el adaptador de vídeo/gráficos emulado. Use esto para VMs "
"headless que no requieren acceso a consola, como appliances dedicados o "
"cargas de trabajo con pass-through de GPU donde la GPU física proporciona"
" la pantalla."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_advanced_options.rst:150
msgid "Memory"
msgstr "Memoria"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_advanced_options.rst:159
#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_advanced_options.rst:226
msgid "Huge Pages"
msgstr "Huge Pages"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_advanced_options.rst:161
msgid ""
"Enables huge pages (2 MB) memory backing for the VM. Huge pages reduce "
"TLB (Translation Lookaside Buffer) misses and improve memory access "
"performance for memory-intensive workloads such as databases and HPC "
"applications. The host must have sufficient free huge pages allocated. "
"*Provision only.*"
msgstr ""
"Habilita respaldo de memoria con huge pages (2 MB) para la VM. Las huge "
"pages reducen fallos de TLB (Translation Lookaside Buffer) y mejoran el "
"rendimiento de acceso a memoria para cargas de trabajo intensivas en "
"memoria como bases de datos y aplicaciones HPC. El host debe tener "
"suficientes huge pages libres asignadas. *Solo aprovisionamiento.*"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_advanced_options.rst:162
#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_advanced_options.rst:229
msgid "vNUMA Mode"
msgstr "vNUMA Mode"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_advanced_options.rst:164
msgid ""
"Controls virtual NUMA topology for the VM. See :doc:`vm_compute` for "
"detailed documentation on vNUMA modes (Off, Auto, Manual)."
msgstr ""
"Controla la topología vNUMA virtual de la VM. Consulte :doc:`vm_compute` "
"para documentación detallada sobre modos vNUMA (Off, Auto, Manual)."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_advanced_options.rst:167
msgid "Identity"
msgstr "Identidad"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_advanced_options.rst:176
#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_advanced_options.rst:232
msgid "Asset Tag"
msgstr "Asset Tag"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_advanced_options.rst:177
msgid "(VM name)"
msgstr "(nombre de VM)"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_advanced_options.rst:178
msgid ""
"Sets the SMBIOS asset tag visible to the guest operating system. If left "
"blank, the VM name is used. This value can be read inside the guest using"
" tools such as ``dmidecode`` and is useful for inventory tracking and "
"automation scripts that need to identify the VM."
msgstr ""
"Establece la etiqueta de activo SMBIOS visible para el sistema operativo "
"invitado. Si se deja en blanco, se usa el nombre de la VM. Este valor "
"puede leerse dentro del invitado con herramientas como ``dmidecode`` y es"
" útil para seguimiento de inventario y scripts de automatización que "
"necesitan identificar la VM."

